t:3px; background:url(\"https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/btnDetail.gif\") no-repeat 0 0; text-indent:-999px; vertical-align:middle;}\r\n\r\n/* 占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎈㎍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌몝�뜝�럥夷ⓨ뜝�럡�맗�뜝�럥裕뗰옙�쐻占쎈윥�뙴湲븍쐪筌먲퐢�렂�뜝�럩援뀐옙�쐻占쎈윪獄��궍�쐻占쎈윥占쎈㎍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌몝�뜝�럩堉뀐옙�굲 占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎈㎍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌몝占쎈쐻占쎈윥鸚룔렔�쐻占쎈윥占쎈㎍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌몝占쎈쐻占쎈윪筌띻막�쐻占쎈윥鸚롤껊쐻占쎈윥筌앸ŀ�쐻占쎈윪�뤃轅⑤쐻占쎈윥占쎈㎍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌몝�뜝�럡�뜦占쎈쐻�뜝占� */\r\n.ypaybtn02 {overflow:hidden; display:inline-block; width:73px; height:17px; background:url(\"https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/btnJoin03.gif\") no-repeat 0 0; text-indent:-999px; vertical-align:middle;}\r\n\r\n/* 占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎈㎍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌몗占쎈쐪筌먦끉�룲占쎈퉲�뜝�뜴�쐻占쎈윪�억옙占쎈쐻占쎈윪筌띾돍�삕占쎌맶�뜝�럥�쑅占쎄턀�뜝�룞�삕占쎌맶�뜝�럥�쑅�뜝�럥堉볡솾�꺂�뒧占쎈�뺝뜝�럥爾잞┼�슢�뿪占쎌굲 */\r\n.scultureColor01 {color:#F44336 !important;\tfont-weight:bold; width:auto;}\r\n\r\n/* 20160523 占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎈㎍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌몝�뜝�럡�뜦�뜝�럡萸띶뜝�럩留띰옙�쐻占쎈윥占쎌몗癲ル슢理볩옙�굲 �뜝�럥�맶�뜝�럥�몘力놂옙�뜝�뜾逾볠�ⓦ끉�굲�뜝�럥�맶�뜝�럥吏쀥뜝�럩援� 占쎌녇占쎄틓占쎈뮛�뜝�럥��占쎈쐻占쎈윞占쎈�닷뜝�럥�늾占쎈쇊癰귨옙占쎄뎡 */\r\n.kgContents .stopInfo {position: absolute; bottom: 20px; left: 19px; display: block; width: 405px; line-height: 30px; color: #F44336; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid #F44336; text-align: center;}\r\n\r\n/*占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎈㎍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌몝�뜝�럩釉わ옙踰됵옙留띰옙�쐻占쎈윥占쎌맽占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌끍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎈㎍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌몗占쎈쐻占쎈윥�댆�벩�쐻占쎈윥占쎈㎍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌맽�뜝�럥堉�占쎈쐻�뜝占� 占쎈쐻占쎈윥鸚롤껊쐻占쎈윥筌앸ŀ�쐻占쎈윪�뤃轅⑤쐻占쎈윥占쎈㎍占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎌몝占쎈쐻占쎈윥�뜝�뜫猷뉛옙�굲�뜝�럩留띰옙�쐻占쎈윥占쎌몗占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎄콣 占쎈쐻占쎈윥占쎈읁占쎈쐻占쎈윥筌앷엥�쐻占쎈쑆占쏙옙嶺뚮쪋�삕�뜝�럥�맶占쎈쐻�뜝占� �뜝�럥�맶�뜝�럥�쑅�뜝�럥猷억옙�쐻占쎈윞�뙼占쏙옙�쐻占쎈윥筌욎�λ쐻占쎈윪�뤃占� */\r\n.btmIpBnr {position:absolute; bottom:14px; left:19px; width:427px; height:70px; background:none;}\r\n*:first-child + html .btmIpBnr{top:350px;}/* IE7 */\r\n\r\n/* GS point */\r\n.btnGspoint {text-align: center; line-height: 30px;}\r\nbutton{border:0;cursor: pointer}\r\n/*2017 added */\r\n.noti_bar{background: #777;position: absolute;bottom:0;width:490px;height:30px;left:0;padding:0 7px;color:#fff;font-size: 15px; line-height: 20px;z-index:5}\r\n.noti_bar #linkButton{background-color:cornflowerblue;border-radius:3px;font-size:15px;}\r\n.noti_bar #btnmq.pause{background: url(https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/newly/btn_ply.png) no-repeat;}\r\n.noti_bar #btnmq{position: absolute;bottom:3px;right:17px;width:15px;height:15px;background: url(https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/newly/btn_stop.png) no-repeat}\r\n.h3_tit{overflow: hidden;padding-bottom:7px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;margin-bottom:8px}\r\n.h3_tit h3{font-size: 13px;color:#323232;display: inline-block;float:left;margin-left:5px}\r\n.agr_all{float:right;display: inline-block;color:#4c4c4c;font-weight: 500;padding-right: 12px}\r\n.agr_all input[type='checkbox']{vertical-align: middle;width:15px;height:15px}\r\n.agrmt_1st{padding:0 5px 10px 5px; overflow: hidden;min-height:40px}\r\n.agrmt_1st h4{font-size: 12px;padding-bottom:3px}\r\n.agrmt_1st dl{width:50%;float:left;overflow: hidden;font-size: 11px;}\r\n.agrmt_1st dt,.agrmt_1st dd{float:left}\r\n.agrmt_1st dt{width:167px}\r\n.agrmt_1st dd input{vertical-align: middle;}\r\n.agr_utilzr{position: relative;border-bottom:1px solid #664499;margin-bottom:18px;}\r\n.agr_utilzr_dis{position: relative;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;margin-bottom:18px;}\r\n.agr_utilzr_dis *{color:#aaa}\r\n.agr_utilzr_dis h3{color:#aaa}\r\n.agr_utilzr_dis .btnAgrmt_detail_dis{background: url(https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/newly/btn_agrmtMore_ko.png) no-repeat;position: absolute;bottom:-9px;left:50%;margin-left:-55px;width:110px;height:18px;border:0;display: inline-block;border-radius:9px;background-color:#aaa;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:center center}\r\n.btnAgrmt_detail{position: absolute;bottom:-9px;left:50%;margin-left:-55px;width:110px;height:18px;border:0;display: inline-block;border-radius:9px;background-color:#664499;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:center center; outline-offset: 2px;}\r\n.btnAgrmt_detail{background-image: url(https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/newly/btn_agrmtMore_ko.png) ;}\r\n.btnAgrmt_detail.minus{background-image: url(https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/newly/btn_agrmMinus_ko.png);}\r\n.dt_agrmt{font-size: 11px;padding:10px 5px 4px 5px;position: relative;font-weight:bold;color:#555}\r\n.agrmt_2nd .dl_agrmt:first-child .dt_agrmt{padding:0 5px 4px 5px;}\r\n.agrWrap{position: absolute;right:0}\r\n.agrWrap input{vertical-align: middle}\r\n.dd_agrmt{font-size: 11px;padding:5px; line-height: 1.5;border-top:1px solid #d8d8d8;;border-bottom:1px solid #d8d8d8;min-height:40px}\r\n.btn_detail{background: url(https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/newly/btn_detail.png) no-repeat;width:16px;height:16px; display: inline-block;margin-left:13px; vertical-align:middle}\r\n.agrmt_2nd{height:402px;background: #fff;display: none}\r\n.ico_qes{background: url(https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/newly/ico_qus.png) no-repeat;height:17px;width:17px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle}\r\n.ban_ini{overflow: hidden;padding:0 5px;margin-bottom:10px}\r\n.ban_ini.dis_ini *{color:#aaa !important}\r\n.ban_ini.dis_ini .ico_qes{background: url(https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/newly/ico_qus_dis.png) no-repeat;}\r\n.link_pr{background: url(https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/newly/btn_useUti.png) no-repeat;width:40px;height:16px;display: inline-block}\r\n.ban_ini.dis_ini .link_pr{background: url(https://stdux.inicis.com/stdpay/img/newly/btn_useUti_dis.png) no-repeat}\r\n.ban_left{float:left;}\r\n.ban_left a{vertical-align:middle}\r\n.ban_slg{color:#c1272c;font-weight:bold;font-size: 13px}\r\n.ban_slg em{font-style: normal;color:#4c4c4c;font-size: 11px}\r\n.ban_right{float: right;font-size: 11px}\r\n.ban_right input{ vertical-align: middle}\r\n.btnPaymnt{display:block;line-height: 35px; height:35px; border:1px solid #e4e4e4; text-align: center;color:#656565; position: relative;border-radius: 8px;}\r\n.btnPaymnt_2{height:30px;line-height:30px}\r\n.btnPaymnt_3{height:28px;line-height:28px;overflow:hidden}\r\n\r\n.btnPaysub{height:28px;line-height:28px;overflow: hidden;}\r\n.btnPaymnt:hover{background: #e6e6e6}\r\n.btnPaymnt img:focus {outline:none}\r\n.btnPaymnt.selected{border:2px solid #664499; background:#fff; height: 33px; line-height: 33px}\r\n.btnPaymnt.selected .img_pay{left: 29px}\r\n.btnPaymnt.selected:hover .img_crd{padding-top: 5px;}\r\n.btnPaymnt .img_crd{display: none;}\r\n.btnPaymnt .img_crdnaver{display: none;}\r\n.btnPaymnt .img_crd_1{display: none;}                                                                                                  \r\n.btnPaymnt:hover .img_crd{display: block; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;margin:0 auto;padding-top:6px}\r\n.btnPaymnt:hover .img_crdnaver{display: block; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;margin:0 auto;padding-top:0px}\r\n.btnPaymnt:hover .img_crd_1{display: block; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;margin:0 auto}\r\n.btnPaymnt:hover span{display: none}\r\n.btnPaymnt.kpay{color:#92278f;font-weight: bold;display: block; padding-left:130px}\r\n.btnPaymnt.samsungpay{color:#0032a0;font-weight: bold ;display: block; padding-left:130px}\r\n.btnPaymnt.payco{color:red;font-weight: bold;display: block; padding-left:100px}\r\n.btnPaymnt.lpay{color:#0093c0;font-weight: bold;display: block; padding-left:100px}\r\n.btnPaymnt.kakaopay{color:#1E1E1E;font-weight: bold;display: block; padding-left:100px}\r\n.btnPaymnt.ssgpay{color:#E24F39;font-weight: bold;display: block; padding-left:100px}\r\n.btnPaymnt.tosspay{color:#0050FF;font-weight: bold;display: block; padding-left:100px}\r\n.btnPaymnt.naverpay{color:#1E1E1E;font-weight: bold;display: block; padding-left:100px}\r\n.btnPaymnt.chaipay{color:#1E1E1E;font-weight: bold;display: block; padding-left:100px}\r\n\r\n.btnPaymnt_2.kpay{height:30px;line-height:30px}\r\n.btnPaymnt_2.samsungpay{height:30px;line-height:30px}\r\n.btnPaymnt_2.payco{height:30px;line-height:30px}\r\n.btnPaymnt_2.lpay{height:30px;line-height:30px}\r\n.btnPaymnt_2.kakaopay{height:30px;line-height:30px}\r\n.btnPaymnt_2.ssgpay{height:30px;line-height:30px}\r\n.btnPaymnt_2.tosspay{height:30px;line-height:30px}\r\n.btnPaymnt_2.naverpay{height:30px;line-height:30px}\r\n.btnPaymnt_2.chaipay{height:30px;line-height:30px}\r\n\r\n.btnPaymnt .img_pay{position:absolute;height:36px;top:0;left:30px}\r\n.btnPaymnt .img_pay img{vertical-align:middle}\r\n.btnPaymnt.kpay:hover span,.btnPaymnt.samsungpay:hover span,.btnPaymnt.payco:hover span, .btnPaymnt.lpay:hover span, .btnPaymnt.kakaopay:hover span, .btnPaymnt.ssgpay:hover span, .btnPaymnt.tosspay:hover span, .btnPaymnt.naverpay:hover span, .btnPaymnt.chaipay:hover span {display: block}\r\n.payWrap .li_sp{margin:0 0 3px 0;padding:0; overflow: hidden;position:relative}\r\n.btn_short{width:108px}\r\n.btn_middle{width:146px;height:28px;overflow:hidden;line-height:29px}\r\n.btn_Pay{width:108px;height:35px;line-height:35px}\r\n.btn_Pay_2{width:108px;height:30px;line-height:30px}\r\n.li_pay.last .btn_short{width:109px}\r\n.li_pay.last .btn_short.selected{ width:107px; }\r\n.li_pay{float:left;margin:0 3px 3px 0}\r\n.li_pay.mgt3{margin:3px 3px 0 0}\r\n.li_pay.last{margin-right:0;}\r\n.li_pay .btnPaymnt.selected{ width: 106px; }\r\n.li_gift{width:150px;display:block;height:38px;float:left; text-align:center}\r\n.btnGift{display:block;height:36px;border:1px solid #e4e4e4; text-align: center;color:#656565;background:#fff;width:148px;padding-bottom:1px;border-radius: 8px;}\r\n.btnGift.selected{border-color:#664499;}\r\n.btnGift span{font-size:12px;font-family:NanumGothic}\r\n.giftWrap{overflow:hidden;}\r\n.selectBox{display: inline-block;line-height: 35px;height:35px;border:1px solid #e4e4e4; text-align: center;color:#656565}\r\n.crdWrap{margin-top:5px;clear:both}\r\n.li_02{width:223px;display: block;float:left}\r\n.li_03{height:27px}\r\n.li_02_1{width:450px;}\r\n.li_02 .btnPaymnt{color:#4c4c4c;font-weight: bold; position: relative;font-family: 'NanumGothic',,'sans-serif'}\r\n.btnPaymntwarp{position: relative;}\r\n.li_02 .btnPaymntwarp .ico_qes{position: absolute;right:27px;top:50%;margin-top:-9px}\r\n.li_pay .btnPaymntwarp .ico_qes{position: absolute;right:18px;top:50%;margin-top:-9px}\r\